{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/Title_1.png?t=1749026719\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/SteamDescription1.gif?t=1749026719\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a young innkeeper helping your witch grandmother manage, decorate, and expand her cozy traveling tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/Title_2.png?t=1749026719\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate the whims of forest sprites and ancient Baltic gods who visit your establishment. Manage staff, craft delightful menus, and make your inn a welcoming haven for all who enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/Title_3.png?t=1749026719\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/SteamDescription3.gif?t=1749026719\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire staff, manage finances, purchase supplies, and maintain your establishment with precision and care. Expand and upgrade your tavern with new rooms, facilities, and attractions to attract more customers and increase revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/Title_4.png?t=1749026719\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/SteamDescription4.gif?t=1749026719\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personalize your inn with a variety of decor elements, including furniture, paintings, and carpets, to create a welcoming and unique atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/Title_5.png?t=1749026719\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/SteamDescription5.gif?t=1749026719\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter a colorful cast of characters inspired by Baltic folklore, from mischievous witches to ethereal forest spirits and majestic pagan gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Co-funded by the MEDIA strand of the European Union\u2019s Creative Europe Programme</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/EU_flag-Crea_EU_+_MEDIA_EN.png?t=1749026719\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3009720?t=1749026719","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749026719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749026719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749026719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/Title_1.png?t=1749026719\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/SteamDescription1.gif?t=1749026719\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a young innkeeper helping your witch grandmother manage, decorate, and expand her cozy traveling tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/Title_2.png?t=1749026719\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate the whims of forest sprites and ancient Baltic gods who visit your establishment. Manage staff, craft delightful menus, and make your inn a welcoming haven for all who enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/Title_3.png?t=1749026719\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/SteamDescription3.gif?t=1749026719\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire staff, manage finances, purchase supplies, and maintain your establishment with precision and care. Expand and upgrade your tavern with new rooms, facilities, and attractions to attract more customers and increase revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/Title_4.png?t=1749026719\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/SteamDescription4.gif?t=1749026719\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personalize your inn with a variety of decor elements, including furniture, paintings, and carpets, to create a welcoming and unique atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/Title_5.png?t=1749026719\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/SteamDescription5.gif?t=1749026719\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter a colorful cast of characters inspired by Baltic folklore, from mischievous witches to ethereal forest spirits and majestic pagan gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Co-funded by the MEDIA strand of the European Union\u2019s Creative Europe Programme</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/extras/EU_flag-Crea_EU_+_MEDIA_EN.png?t=1749026719\" /></div></p>","developers":["SneakyBox"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009720/header.jpg?t=1749026719","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04 LTS</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.9.5 - 10.11.6</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257028310,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028310/movie480.mp4?t=1749026716","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028310/movie_max.mp4?t=1749026716"},"name":"Reveal trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.ste